1. Project Scope Statement
Chosen App: Flipkart-style Smart E-Commerce Application
The proposed React application is a Smart E-Commerce Dashboard inspired by apps such as Flipkart. The main problem it aims to solve is the difficulty of efficiently discovering products, comparing available options, managing a shopping cart, and tracking purchases through a simple interface. The application would provide users with product search, filtering, product details, wishlist, cart, checkout, and order management features, while also giving sellers or administrators a dashboard to manage products and monitor basic sales information. The main users would be online shoppers and sellers/administrators who need a convenient and organized e-commerce platform.
2. Five Core Features – Smart E-Commerce Dashboard
No.	Core Feature	How It Helps the User
1	Product Management	Sellers can add, edit, delete, and update product information so their online catalog stays accurate.
2	Sales & Revenue Dashboard	Sellers can view important statistics such as total sales, orders, revenue, and product performance in one place.
3	Order Management	Sellers can view and update customer orders and track their order status efficiently.
4	Product Search & Filtering	Users can quickly find relevant products by using keywords, categories, price ranges, ratings, and other filters.
5	Inventory / Stock Management	Sellers can monitor available stock and identify low-stock products so they can avoid unnecessary out-of-stock situations.
3. Five Unique Features for an AI-Powered Resume Builder
1.	1. AI Resume Score & Analysis: AI analyzes the resume and provides an overall score with suggestions for improving weak sections, wording, and structure.
2.	2. Job Description Matching: Users can paste a job description and AI identifies missing skills, keywords, and experience that could improve the resume's relevance.
3.	3. AI Bullet Point Improver: AI can convert simple job or project descriptions into stronger, professional, achievement-oriented resume bullet points.
4.	4. Personalized Resume Suggestions: AI can recommend different content and emphasis based on the user's selected target role, such as Java Developer, Frontend Developer, or Full Stack Developer.
5.	5. AI Cover Letter Generator: After analyzing the resume and target job description, AI can generate a personalized cover letter that matches the candidate's profile and the position.
